{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00001","name":"Crafting Edge","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"<p>On any critical success, roll d3. Use Final Block (d4) when accelerated work could finish the contribution. Result 4 is final-block only: if 100% work is insufficient, use Accelerated Work instead; otherwise roll the Masterstroke table.</p><p>Manual table rolls show results in chat. The Workbench already resolves these rolls automatically; do not apply a manual result a second time.</p>","formula":"1d3","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"craftingTable":"wmCraftEdge00001"}},"results":[{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00001","type":"text","name":"Accelerated Work","description":"<p><strong>Accelerated Work</strong></p><p>Generate 150% of committed days as work, rounded up. No additional effect.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00002","type":"text","name":"Material Conservation","description":"<p><strong>Material Conservation</strong></p><p>Generate 100% work. Preserve workshop consumables worth up to 10% of one selected Resource Unit used by this contribution. This credit cannot be sold or converted into fractional Resource Units.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00003","type":"text","name":"Stable Integration","description":"<p><strong>Stable Integration</strong></p><p>Generate 150% work, rounded up. Gain a +2 circumstance bonus to the next Work Block for this contribution.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmCraftEdge00004","type":"text","name":"Masterstroke Opportunity","description":"<p><strong>Masterstroke Opportunity</strong></p><p>Generate 100% work. If this completes the contribution, roll a Masterstroke; otherwise, use Accelerated Work.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false}]}
{"_id":"wmMasterstroke01","name":"Masterstroke — Weapons","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"<p>Roll after Masterstroke Opportunity completes the final Work Block. An item can have one Masterstroke, retained through upgrades. Manual rolls are reference only; Workbench rolls attach the result automatically.</p>","formula":"1d8","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"craftingTable":"wmMasterstroke01"}},"results":[{"_id":"wmMasterstrok001","type":"text","name":"Perfect Balance","description":"<p><strong>Perfect Balance</strong></p><p>Reduce this weapon’s multiple attack penalty by 2 on every Strike, minimum 0.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok002","type":"text","name":"Unerring Strike","description":"<p><strong>Unerring Strike</strong></p><p>Once per encounter, improve a failed Strike to a success. Critical failures are unaffected.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok003","type":"text","name":"Unyielding Edge","description":"<p><strong>Unyielding Edge</strong></p><p>Ignore 10 points of resistance to this weapon’s physical damage. Immunities and Voidborn protection still apply.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok004","type":"text","name":"Relentless Assault","description":"<p><strong>Relentless Assault</strong></p><p>Once per encounter after missing, immediately make another Strike with this weapon as a free action at the same multiple attack penalty. Both attacks count towards subsequent penalties.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok005","type":"text","name":"Guardian’s Weapon","description":"<p><strong>Guardian’s Weapon</strong></p><p>After hitting, gain +2 circumstance AC until your next turn. Once per encounter also gain temporary HP equal to your level for 1 minute.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok006","type":"text","name":"Overwhelming Impact","description":"<p><strong>Overwhelming Impact</strong></p><p>Once per turn on a critical hit, knock the target prone or push it up to 10 feet. The target can be up to two sizes larger.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok007","type":"text","name":"Artisan’s Triumph","description":"<p><strong>Artisan’s Triumph</strong></p><p>Once per day, improve a successful Strike to a critical success.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[7,7],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok008","type":"text","name":"Limitless Channel","description":"<p><strong>Limitless Channel</strong></p><p>Gain one additional property-rune slot, allowing four total. Acquire and apply the rune separately.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[8,8],"drawn":false}]}
{"_id":"wmMasterstroke02","name":"Masterstroke — Equipment","img":"icons/svg/d20-grey.svg","description":"<p>For armour, shields, spell focuses and other equipment. Reroll incompatible results. An item can have one Masterstroke, retained through upgrades. Workbench rolls select compatible results automatically.</p>","formula":"1d8","replacement":true,"displayRoll":true,"ownership":{"default":2},"flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"craftingTable":"wmMasterstroke02"}},"results":[{"_id":"wmMasterstrok001","type":"text","name":"Indomitable Construction","description":"<p><strong>Indomitable Construction</strong></p><p>Triple maximum HP and Broken Threshold; increase Hardness by 5.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[1,1],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok002","type":"text","name":"Protective Finish","description":"<p><strong>Protective Finish</strong></p><p>Armour or raised shield: once per round, reduce damage from one hit by 10 after other reductions.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[2,2],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok003","type":"text","name":"Defy Death","description":"<p><strong>Defy Death</strong></p><p>Armour: once per encounter, turn a critical hit against you into a normal hit.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[3,3],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok004","type":"text","name":"Unbreakable Guard","description":"<p><strong>Unbreakable Guard</strong></p><p>Shield: +5 Hardness. Once per encounter when you Shield Block, the shield takes no damage; you take damage normally after Hardness.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[4,4],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok005","type":"text","name":"Perfect Focus","description":"<p><strong>Perfect Focus</strong></p><p>Spell focus: once per encounter, improve a failed spell attack to a success, or make one target’s successful spell save a failure. Critical failures and successes are unaffected.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[5,5],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok006","type":"text","name":"Adamant Will","description":"<p><strong>Adamant Will</strong></p><p>Worn equipment: once per encounter, improve a failed saving throw to a success. Critical failures are unaffected.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[6,6],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok007","type":"text","name":"Weightless Wonder","description":"<p><strong>Weightless Wonder</strong></p><p>The item has negligible Bulk. Worn armour also loses its Speed penalty and Strength-based check penalty.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[7,7],"drawn":false},{"_id":"wmMasterstrok008","type":"text","name":"Limitless Channel","description":"<p><strong>Limitless Channel</strong></p><p>Armour: gain one additional property-rune slot, allowing four total. Acquire and apply the rune separately.</p>","img":"icons/svg/anvil.svg","weight":1,"range":[8,8],"drawn":false}]}
